Z||000003||Haze_Performance||10-01-2000||02:58 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DjKid:<BR><B>Would I be ricing my car up if I put SS badges on my car? I know they never made a SS Fiero.. but they never made a factory 95-96-97 SS Camaro.. but you can still buy em.. they were aftermarket additions .. not factory. SS didn't come back from the factory till 98  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I am a camaro nutt by trade   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Fiero Nutt by passion  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Goto the Pontiac Dealer and buy a WS6 emblem. (On the rear bumper of the Ram Air Trans Am's) That wouldnt be ricey. There are WS6 Fieros + all Fieros are Ram Air.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">  <P><B>Website's<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A><P>                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||14
