Z||000020||Tigger||10-02-2000||03:49 PM||||If the Fiero was made by Chevrolet, then SS would work, or maybe if you've got a V8 swap.<P>Here's a couple other ideas: (I couldn't resist)<P>How about "Fiero BS" <B>B</B>riggs & <B>S</B>tratton?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Fiero SSEi?<P>Or how about something with an X in it, like the Mazda RX-7.   Hmmm...  If you have a Fiero SE like mine maybe something like "Fiero SE-X" would work?<P>Kinda sounds experimental doesn't it   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">           <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A>  <p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 10-02-2000).]||||reg||1
