Z||000028||Tigger||10-04-2000||04:32 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.webpti.com/dan/cars/images/ramprix1.jpg"> <BR>1998 Pontiac Grand Prix GTX Ram Air<P>I'm not for certain if the name was used just for the concept of a Ram Air hood on a GP because I've seen GP's on the street with this hood but not sure if was a production or aftermarket thing.||||reg||1
